R</given-names></name><name><surname>Connell</surname><given-names>JMC</given-names></name><name><surname>Davies</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Regulation of aldosterone synthase gene expression in the rat adrenal gland and central nervous system by sodium and angiotensin II</article-title><source>Endocrinology</source><volume>144</volume><year>2003</year><fpage>3321</fpage><lpage>3328</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12865309</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib24"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ye</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Kenyon</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>MacKenzie</surname><given-names>SM</given-names></name><name><surname>Jong</surname><given-names>AS</given-names></name><name><surname>Miller</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Gray</surname><given-names>GA</given-names></name><name><surname>Wallace</surname><given-names>AM</given-names></name><name><surname>Ryding</surname><given-names>ADS</given-names></name><name><surname>Mullins</surname><given-names>JJ</given-names></name><name><surname>McBride</surname><given-names>MW</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>The aldosterone synthase (CYP11B2) and 11&#x003b2;-hydroxylase (CYP11B1) genes are not expressed in the rat heart</article-title><source>Endocrinology</source><volume>146</volume><year>2005</year><fpage>5287</fpage><lpage>5293</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16179417</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back><floats-wrap><fig id="fig1" position="float"><label>Figure 1</label><caption><p>(a and b) Effect of ACTH and dexamethasone infusion on fecal corticosterone and aldosterone production.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="JOE070439f01"/></fig><fig id="fig2" position="float"><label>Figure 2</label><caption><p>(a and b) Effect of ACTH and dexamethasone infusion on central <italic>CYP11B1</italic>